OL,3,GNEWSACambridge scientist dies in
OL,4,ASpanish train crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn award-winning University of
OL,7,FCambridge researcher died in the
OL,8,FSpanish train disaster while on her way
OL,9,Fto collect a prize for scientific
OL,10,Fexcellence.
OL,12,FDr Marta Shahbazi was travelling to an
OL,13,Fawards ceremony on Wednesday when the
OL,14,Ftrain she was on crashed into another
OL,15,Fnear Urda, south of Madrid, killing 69
OL,16,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
